<title>USA: Iraq to tender for 30,000T U.S. rice - US exporters.</title>
<headline>Iraq to tender for 30,000T U.S. rice - US exporters.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iraq will tender on February 3 for 30,000 tonnes of U.S. long grain rice under that nation's &quot;food-for-oil&quot; program, U.S. exporters said.</p>
<p>The tender is divided into two 15,000-tonne positions, with one slated for April delivery and the other for May delivery, exporters said.</p>
</text>
